(5443882, 781404, 96721, '<td valign="top">Composition feels a little awkward but I do like the shadows</td>', 'Composition feels a little awkward but I do like the shadows', '2009-04-19 15:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5443883, 781456, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space, I like the idea too and a feeling of confinement / being caged definitely comes across, I do feel the girl looks a little soft though</td>', 'Nice use of negative space, I like the idea too and a feeling of confinement / being caged definitely comes across, I do feel the girl looks a little soft though', '2009-04-19 15:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5443884, 782361, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nice patterns and a well executed shot, I wonder if the subject matter will cause your scores to suffer a little though (it''s not overly interesting apart from the patterns).</td>', 'Nice patterns and a well executed shot, I wonder if the subject matter will cause your scores to suffer a little though (it''s not overly interesting apart from the patterns).', '2009-04-19 15:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5443885, 782337, 96721, '<td valign="top">This could have been very good, not sure what it is but something looks a little strange in the middle of the back region (maybe processing but it looks a little blown in the back of the bird and the rest looks slightly tinted / tinged).</td>', 'This could have been very good, not sure what it is but something looks a little strange in the middle of the back region (maybe processing but it looks a little blown in the back of the bird and the rest looks slightly tinted / tinged).', '2009-04-19 15:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5443886, 781751, 96721, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones in the sky but the lighthouse seems a little flat maybe a slight contrast boost would help.</td>', 'Lovely tones in the sky but the lighthouse seems a little flat maybe a slight contrast boost would help.', '2009-04-19 15:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5443888, 781759, 96721, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of gun shots but this is nicely done, I like the drama created but the lighting</td>', 'Not a fan of gun shots but this is nicely done, I like the drama created but the lighting', '2009-04-19 15:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5443890, 781843, 96721, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot, nice use of the posts to act as a frame, love the slight desat  feel - only a couple of nitpicks really, seems a little cluttered in the foreground with the plate and knife and the water looks a little over sharpened.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot, nice use of the posts to act as a frame, love the slight desat  feel - only a couple of nitpicks really, seems a little cluttered in the foreground with the plate and knife and the water looks a little over sharpened.', '2009-04-19 16:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5443891, 782162, 96721, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro, shame about the 2 tone bg as I think all black would have be great, but that is 1 very sharp spider!</td>', 'Very nice macro, shame about the 2 tone bg as I think all black would have be great, but that is 1 very sharp spider!', '2009-04-19 16:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5443893, 781025, 96721, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the sort of lighting I love using on portraits / portfolio images - love the negative space and the mystery caused by not seeing her eye.<br/> <br/>9</td>', 'Great shot, the sort of lighting I love using on portraits / portfolio images - love the negative space and the mystery caused by not seeing her eye. 9', '2009-04-19 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5443899, 782034, 96721, '<td valign="top">At first I really liked this, once I looked at it for a while I didn''t like it quite as much, not sure what it is something feels strange maybe the composition, or it maybe the contrast in the daff petals seemingly high, I can''t quite put my finger on it.</td>', 'At first I really liked this, once I looked at it for a while I didn''t like it quite as much, not sure what it is something feels strange maybe the composition, or it maybe the contrast in the daff petals seemingly high, I can''t quite put my finger on it.', '2009-04-19 16:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
