(5443907, 781825, 96721, '<td valign="top">Although the lighting is quite interesting the subject is the main problem, everything is a little too far away to really grab the viewer, use of this light on a single well placed subject could have yielded fantastic results.</td>', 'Although the lighting is quite interesting the subject is the main problem, everything is a little too far away to really grab the viewer, use of this light on a single well placed subject could have yielded fantastic results.', '2009-04-19 16:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
