(5444088, 780748, 55838, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  Nice DOF and B&amp;W.  Back you bump you up to 8.</td>', 'Cool shot.  Nice DOF and B&W.  Back you bump you up to 8.', '2009-04-19 19:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444273, 782189, 101256, '<td valign="top">An effective use of natural lighting, the flower displays excellant detail - a very natural setting. It might have been more impressive if some of the background details were missing. A good entry demonstrating technical control of the subject matter.</td>', 'An effective use of natural lighting, the flower displays excellant detail - a very natural setting. It might have been more impressive if some of the background details were missing. A good entry demonstrating technical control of the subject matter.', '2009-04-19 22:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444280, 782441, 101256, '<td valign="top">Slightly overdone whites and more detail than is needed to demonstrate effective use of lighting. A different angle would have been a plus and a less subject with a closer viewpoint would have also helped. A good demonstration of angled natural light.</td>', 'Slightly overdone whites and more detail than is needed to demonstrate effective use of lighting. A different angle would have been a plus and a less subject with a closer viewpoint would have also helped. A good demonstration of angled natural light.', '2009-04-19 22:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444303, 782260, 101256, '<td valign="top">A natural setting and natural light only seen during certain times of the year. A good demonstration of how light affects the natural world and images in general. The only flaw is the darker section which detracts from the overall effect. A crop from the right would have helped. A good entry into the challenge and a potential top twenty.</td>', 'A natural setting and natural light only seen during certain times of the year. A good demonstration of how light affects the natural world and images in general. The only flaw is the darker section which detracts from the overall effect. A crop from the right would have helped. A good entry into the challenge and a potential top twenty.', '2009-04-19 22:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444307, 782216, 101256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and natural, highly detailed and effective use of ambient lighting. A view of the natural world only seen in the American South West. The highlights are right on the edge of being overdone which demonstrates technical competance with ambient light. A top twenty image.</td>', 'Beautiful and natural, highly detailed and effective use of ambient lighting. A view of the natural world only seen in the American South West. The highlights are right on the edge of being overdone which demonstrates technical competance with ambient light. A top twenty image.', '2009-04-19 22:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444308, 781263, 31637, '<td valign="top">Fantastic composition, great drama without showing too much.</td>', 'Fantastic composition, great drama without showing too much.', '2009-04-19 22:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444310, 782162, 31637, '<td valign="top">Nice one, lighting is a bit flat though.</td>', 'Nice one, lighting is a bit flat though.', '2009-04-19 22:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444312, 781717, 101256, '<td valign="top">A natural setting, natural and common action captured perfectly. Very effective use of foreground lighting to enhance the hand and provide detail. A great flame capture, this black and white treatment is a solid demonstration of how to control light and properly treat an image. Well done.</td>', 'A natural setting, natural and common action captured perfectly. Very effective use of foreground lighting to enhance the hand and provide detail. A great flame capture, this black and white treatment is a solid demonstration of how to control light and properly treat an image. Well done.', '2009-04-19 22:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444314, 782227, 101256, '<td valign="top">The dramatic movement from dark to light is impressive and extremely effective in this setting. Well thought out, crisp, clear and sharp, the image is emotionally powerful and demonstrates how natural lighting is used to evoke emotion. Not a single flaw. Well done.</td>', 'The dramatic movement from dark to light is impressive and extremely effective in this setting. Well thought out, crisp, clear and sharp, the image is emotionally powerful and demonstrates how natural lighting is used to evoke emotion. Not a single flaw. Well done.', '2009-04-19 22:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444317, 781902, 31637, '<td valign="top">looks like an oil painting!</td>', 'looks like an oil painting!', '2009-04-19 22:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444318, 781842, 101256, '<td valign="top">Manufactured light in a dark setting - long exposure that isn''t quite as crisp as one would expect. The overuse of dark space detracts from the laser image and the red frame creates some confusion in viewing. A good entry into the challenge, it falls just short of demonstrating the use of light for a purpose.</td>', 'Manufactured light in a dark setting - long exposure that isn''t quite as crisp as one would expect. The overuse of dark space detracts from the laser image and the red frame creates some confusion in viewing. A good entry into the challenge, it falls just short of demonstrating the use of light for a purpose.', '2009-04-19 22:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444323, 781606, 101256, '<td valign="top">Natural light and good shade control - a little less impressive that it should be because of the blank background. Some detail would have helped demonstrate total light control. There are some highlights along the birds body which are a negative an unfortunate reflective by product of the birds feather spurs. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Natural light and good shade control - a little less impressive that it should be because of the blank background. Some detail would have helped demonstrate total light control. There are some highlights along the birds body which are a negative an unfortunate reflective by product of the birds feather spurs. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-19 22:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444325, 782206, 101256, '<td valign="top">A practical demonstration of back lighting and how to control it. Every detail is well exposed and highlights are absent demonstrating the author knows well how to properly use ambient light to the maximum effect. Well done.</td>', 'A practical demonstration of back lighting and how to control it. Every detail is well exposed and highlights are absent demonstrating the author knows well how to properly use ambient light to the maximum effect. Well done.', '2009-04-19 22:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444326, 782206, 31637, '<td valign="top">Holy cow! awesome shot in Wide Angle, this is timeless journalism.</td>', 'Holy cow! awesome shot in Wide Angle, this is timeless journalism.', '2009-04-19 22:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444327, 781747, 101256, '<td valign="top">The light on this subject is over balanced to the left and with the offset subject, creates a slightly negative effect on the viewer. The lighting is not well controlled as there are light blooms and color fades which is probably the result of relying on the camera''s spot meter to set the image parameters. A little more thought and positioning, plus the use of a light meter would have helped.</td>', 'The light on this subject is over balanced to the left and with the offset subject, creates a slightly negative effect on the viewer. The lighting is not well controlled as there are light blooms and color fades which is probably the result of relying on the camera''s spot meter to set the image parameters. A little more thought and positioning, plus the use of a light meter would have helped.', '2009-04-19 22:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444329, 781250, 101256, '<td valign="top">While not a complete demonstration of lighting, the fisheye effect is excellant and the lighting angle increases the overall impact of the image from an emotional standpoint. The interesting angles of light from the direct in your face effect of the background to the light coming from the side is very effective. A good and different demonstration of natural lighting to enhance the impact of an image.</td>', 'While not a complete demonstration of lighting, the fisheye effect is excellant and the lighting angle increases the overall impact of the image from an emotional standpoint. The interesting angles of light from the direct in your face effect of the background to the light coming from the side is very effective. A good and different demonstration of natural lighting to enhance the impact of an image.', '2009-04-19 22:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444330, 781911, 101256, '<td valign="top">Soft natural lighting make this a very effective image and the subject''s complexion only enhances the effect. The soft well controlled and lighted background does not overpower the lighting demonstration. Unfortunately, the top of the image is a distraction as it is slightly over the edge and distracting. A solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Soft natural lighting make this a very effective image and the subject''s complexion only enhances the effect. The soft well controlled and lighted background does not overpower the lighting demonstration. Unfortunately, the top of the image is a distraction as it is slightly over the edge and distracting. A solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-19 22:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444331, 782200, 101256, '<td valign="top">Natural lighting, the highlights are slightly over the edge. The light ray effect is very effective and a plus. The overdark foreground could have treated better with more light, but the image works as a lighting demonstration and the effects one can obtain by careful composition. Well done.</td>', 'Natural lighting, the highlights are slightly over the edge. The light ray effect is very effective and a plus. The overdark foreground could have treated better with more light, but the image works as a lighting demonstration and the effects one can obtain by careful composition. Well done.', '2009-04-19 22:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444332, 782442, 101256, '<td valign="top">Natural light in a macro setting, it''s hard to complain about anything concerning the lighting - the image, yes, but the lighting no. Well done.</td>', 'Natural light in a macro setting, it''s hard to complain about anything concerning the lighting - the image, yes, but the lighting no. Well done.', '2009-04-19 22:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444335, 781828, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good effort not properly thought through - the white space is over done and does not compliment the subject or the transition to darker shades. The stark contrast between the background the foreground is also a negative.</td>', 'A good effort not properly thought through - the white space is over done and does not compliment the subject or the transition to darker shades. The stark contrast between the background the foreground is also a negative.', '2009-04-19 22:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444342, 782031, 101256, '<td valign="top">A sound demonstration of natural lighting against a figured subject is a good demonstation of the effective use of natural light. The transition from light to shade is well controlled and very smooth. A solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A sound demonstration of natural lighting against a figured subject is a good demonstation of the effective use of natural light. The transition from light to shade is well controlled and very smooth. A solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-19 22:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444356, 782349, 101256, '<td valign="top">The background light is very effective and provides an ethereal effect on the color feather. A very good demonstration of how this type of lighting is used. A little over done in one area, but the soft glow is important to the overall impact of the image. Well done - a worthy entry into the challenge and a potential top twenty.</td>', 'The background light is very effective and provides an ethereal effect on the color feather. A very good demonstration of how this type of lighting is used. A little over done in one area, but the soft glow is important to the overall impact of the image. Well done - a worthy entry into the challenge and a potential top twenty.', '2009-04-19 22:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444364, 782300, 101256, '<td valign="top">The natural lighting on the subject is a little overdone leading to an awkward transition from light to dark. The lighter shade on the tree limb is distracting and does not enhance the image in any way. A little more thought into the composition would have produced a more effective image.</td>', 'The natural lighting on the subject is a little overdone leading to an awkward transition from light to dark. The lighter shade on the tree limb is distracting and does not enhance the image in any way. A little more thought into the composition would have produced a more effective image.', '2009-04-19 22:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444365, 781206, 101256, '<td valign="top">The use of light as the subject is inspired and unique in this challenge. A little softer treatment would have been a plus, but it is very effective as it is. A good and creative demonstration of the use of light as the subject. Well done.</td>', 'The use of light as the subject is inspired and unique in this challenge. A little softer treatment would have been a plus, but it is very effective as it is. A good and creative demonstration of the use of light as the subject. Well done.', '2009-04-19 22:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444368, 782373, 101256, '<td valign="top">Uneven lighting created a challenge for the author and it falls just shy of being a technical success. A better crop and more concentration on the lower half of the image with a better crop, including cropping out the spot light, would have been a better choice.</td>', 'Uneven lighting created a challenge for the author and it falls just shy of being a technical success. A better crop and more concentration on the lower half of the image with a better crop, including cropping out the spot light, would have been a better choice.', '2009-04-19 22:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444369, 780988, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very effective night shot unfortunately affected by light blooms that aren''t in focused and the over done light bloom on the ones that are in focus. A litte better control of ISO and ambient light would have helped to improve this image. Artistically a success, it is just shy of being a technical success.</td>', 'A very effective night shot unfortunately affected by light blooms that aren''t in focused and the over done light bloom on the ones that are in focus. A litte better control of ISO and ambient light would have helped to improve this image. Artistically a success, it is just shy of being a technical success.', '2009-04-19 22:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444372, 781789, 101256, '<td valign="top">The comparision between light and shadow is good, but the image fails to impact the viewer in any way other than being a good snap shot. A more natural, full body shot showing the contrast between a well light model and the shadow would have been a better choice.</td>', 'The comparision between light and shadow is good, but the image fails to impact the viewer in any way other than being a good snap shot. A more natural, full body shot showing the contrast between a well light model and the shadow would have been a better choice.', '2009-04-19 22:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444375, 782162, 101256, '<td valign="top">A sound image highly detailed and properly lighted. A technical success, it demonstrates proper camera and light control in a macro image. Well done.</td>', 'A sound image highly detailed and properly lighted. A technical success, it demonstrates proper camera and light control in a macro image. Well done.', '2009-04-19 22:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444377, 781394, 101256, '<td valign="top">Soft and gentle lighting on a soft and gentle subject. A great demonstration of how to control all aspects of macro photography as the image does not have any shadows and the subject is sharp and crisp. A very worthy challenge entry.</td>', 'Soft and gentle lighting on a soft and gentle subject. A great demonstration of how to control all aspects of macro photography as the image does not have any shadows and the subject is sharp and crisp. A very worthy challenge entry.', '2009-04-19 22:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444379, 782445, 101256, '<td valign="top">Inventive, the shadow could have used more direct back lighting to make the doubt clearer and more effective with respect to the title. A softer light might have helped reduce the highlights and made the image a more appropriate demonstration of lighting control.</td>', 'Inventive, the shadow could have used more direct back lighting to make the doubt clearer and more effective with respect to the title. A softer light might have helped reduce the highlights and made the image a more appropriate demonstration of lighting control.', '2009-04-19 22:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444381, 781076, 101256, '<td valign="top">While the author''s intent was clear, the highlight blooms detract from what could be a spectacular image. A softer approach lighting this image would have been better reducing the highlights. Not a terribly effective use of light to enhance the subject.</td>', 'While the author''s intent was clear, the highlight blooms detract from what could be a spectacular image. A softer approach lighting this image would have been better reducing the highlights. Not a terribly effective use of light to enhance the subject.', '2009-04-19 22:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444385, 782376, 101256, '<td valign="top">While the lighting of the cross is extremely effective, the background detracts from the image and impacts it negatively. If a narrow focus only on the subject is used to rate this image, it would have to be a nine because of it''s extreme emotional impact and use of lighting.</td>', 'While the lighting of the cross is extremely effective, the background detracts from the image and impacts it negatively. If a narrow focus only on the subject is used to rate this image, it would have to be a nine because of it''s extreme emotional impact and use of lighting.', '2009-04-19 22:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444389, 782068, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant and effective - the author''s choice of subject and lighting is nearly perfect. The minor over done light on the chest of the subject is a distraction, but given the general atmosphere projected by this image, it more than meets the criteria of effective lighting demonstration. Well done - a ribbon contender.</td>', 'Simple, elegant and effective - the author''s choice of subject and lighting is nearly perfect. The minor over done light on the chest of the subject is a distraction, but given the general atmosphere projected by this image, it more than meets the criteria of effective lighting demonstration. Well done - a ribbon contender.', '2009-04-19 23:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444390, 782132, 101256, '<td valign="top">An excellant demonstration of how to control articifial light. The highlights are right on the edge of being overdone and very effective. A wonderful example of how to control lighting with proper camera and light control. Well done - a top selection for a ribbon.</td>', 'An excellant demonstration of how to control articifial light. The highlights are right on the edge of being overdone and very effective. A wonderful example of how to control lighting with proper camera and light control. Well done - a top selection for a ribbon.', '2009-04-19 23:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444402, 782432, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not a terribly interesting use of lighting or of how lighting affects the natural world. More thought into how this particular type of light affects the natural world would have made for a better image.</td>', 'Not a terribly interesting use of lighting or of how lighting affects the natural world. More thought into how this particular type of light affects the natural world would have made for a better image.', '2009-04-19 23:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444410, 782053, 101256, '<td valign="top">More of a picture of creative lighting than a use of creative lighting. The image is a good one even if it slightly misunderstands the nature of the challenge subject.</td>', 'More of a picture of creative lighting than a use of creative lighting. The image is a good one even if it slightly misunderstands the nature of the challenge subject.', '2009-04-19 23:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444414, 781502, 101256, '<td valign="top">The side light to create effect is a good attempt, it fails to provoke any sense of being unusual and is somewhat distracting from the subjects face. It might have been a better approach to back light the head to create a halo effect and provide some drama to the image.</td>', 'The side light to create effect is a good attempt, it fails to provoke any sense of being unusual and is somewhat distracting from the subjects face. It might have been a better approach to back light the head to create a halo effect and provide some drama to the image.', '2009-04-19 23:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444420, 781263, 101256, '<td valign="top">More a image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.</td>', 'More a image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.', '2009-04-19 23:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
