(5445196, 780996, 74979, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking this is Judi''s hubby...again...! nice lighting, does look a bit evil</td>', 'I''m thinking this is Judi''s hubby...again...! nice lighting, does look a bit evil', '2009-04-20 11:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445198, 782206, 74979, '<td valign="top">awesome !!</td>', 'awesome !!', '2009-04-20 11:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445201, 780996, 83544, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, to see this dude one time is interesting, but second time I don''t think so, but not to be so subjective I still give this photo a 10, beacause of the awesome lighting</td>', 'Hmmm, to see this dude one time is interesting, but second time I don''t think so, but not to be so subjective I still give this photo a 10, beacause of the awesome lighting', '2009-04-20 11:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445210, 780996, 23098, '<td valign="top">Excellent low key image. Nice work.</td>', 'Excellent low key image. Nice work.', '2009-04-20 11:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445211, 781382, 83544, '<td valign="top">Sorry to say this but the other simular photo with this one is so much better</td>', 'Sorry to say this but the other simular photo with this one is so much better', '2009-04-20 11:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445217, 782114, 83544, '<td valign="top">Hmmm the photo would be so much better if u just shoot the model, not to show us that she is in a studio, to see the source of the lighting in this photo is really unecesary</td>', 'Hmmm the photo would be so much better if u just shoot the model, not to show us that she is in a studio, to see the source of the lighting in this photo is really unecesary', '2009-04-20 11:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445219, 780730, 83544, '<td valign="top">One of the best photos in this contest, great idea btw</td>', 'One of the best photos in this contest, great idea btw', '2009-04-20 11:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445242, 782132, 101838, '<td valign="top">Nothing wrong with the shot, but I feel like this composition is becoming too much of a cliche here.</td>', 'Nothing wrong with the shot, but I feel like this composition is becoming too much of a cliche here.', '2009-04-20 12:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445244, 782047, 101838, '<td valign="top">You can''t loose with Polar lights, but does not mean you can always win, I''d prefer mountains instead of those trees. I wonder how you got the red light on the road ... - car brakes? Nice touch.</td>', 'You can''t loose with Polar lights, but does not mean you can always win, I''d prefer mountains instead of those trees. I wonder how you got the red light on the road ... - car brakes? Nice touch.', '2009-04-20 12:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445246, 780792, 101838, '<td valign="top">Cute kid, great detail, I just wish that octagon was not such an eye draw ... I guess I''d move farther to avoid it.</td>', 'Cute kid, great detail, I just wish that octagon was not such an eye draw ... I guess I''d move farther to avoid it.', '2009-04-20 12:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445247, 782238, 101838, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, but I wonder how it would look with a single light or even 2 small lights. I mean to fight all that blurriness of shadows...</td>', 'Interesting composition, but I wonder how it would look with a single light or even 2 small lights. I mean to fight all that blurriness of shadows...', '2009-04-20 12:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445250, 781121, 101838, '<td valign="top">Too much of the black stone/rock on the left. Nice colors.</td>', 'Too much of the black stone/rock on the left. Nice colors.', '2009-04-20 12:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445301, 781674, 101256, '<td valign="top">The difference between an image of light and a creative use of light is perfectly demonstrated in this wonderful mood piece. The author has created a terrific mood piece demonstrating grace and style with minimum lighting accenting the gentle curves and graceful colors of burning candles. This an exceptional image in this challenge and should be a ribbon contender.</td>', 'The difference between an image of light and a creative use of light is perfectly demonstrated in this wonderful mood piece. The author has created a terrific mood piece demonstrating grace and style with minimum lighting accenting the gentle curves and graceful colors of burning candles. This an exceptional image in this challenge and should be a ribbon contender.', '2009-04-20 12:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445308, 781121, 101256, '<td valign="top">More an image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.</td>', 'More an image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.', '2009-04-20 12:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445309, 782026, 101256, '<td valign="top">More an image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.</td>', 'More an image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.', '2009-04-20 12:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445310, 782033, 101256, '<td valign="top">More an image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.</td>', 'More an image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.', '2009-04-20 12:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445313, 781885, 101256, '<td valign="top">While the use of natural light is very effective, it falls somewhat short of of being a creative use of light. It might have been a more effective and interesting image if the author had concentrated on the shadows and edges of the petals rather than the flower as a whole.</td>', 'While the use of natural light is very effective, it falls somewhat short of of being a creative use of light. It might have been a more effective and interesting image if the author had concentrated on the shadows and edges of the petals rather than the flower as a whole.', '2009-04-20 12:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445314, 780994, 101256, '<td valign="top">More an image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.</td>', 'More an image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.', '2009-04-20 12:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445316, 782117, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is one of the more marginal images in this challenge if only because it is an effective use of LED lighting to create some lighting effects, but it borders on the edge of being a straight shot of a LED.  This might have been a better image if the grain could be held and presented in color as the conversion is a little less than completely successful. Benefit of the doubt to the author.</td>', 'This is one of the more marginal images in this challenge if only because it is an effective use of LED lighting to create some lighting effects, but it borders on the edge of being a straight shot of a LED.  This might have been a better image if the grain could be held and presented in color as the conversion is a little less than completely successful. Benefit of the doubt to the author.', '2009-04-20 12:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445319, 782443, 101256, '<td valign="top">Different use of light and creative in every respect. Nicely lighted, the white are right on the edge which is a positive from a technical standpoint. From an artistic standpoint, it suffers from a loss of facet detail, but that is countered by the very interesting effect of the gentle curves of the light source itself. The top light bloom is distracting by being ever so slightly over done. A good solid demonstration of the creative use of lighting on the subject and a clever idea both from the technical and artistic aspects. Should place well in the challenge.</td>', 'Different use of light and creative in every respect. Nicely lighted, the white are right on the edge which is a positive from a technical standpoint. From an artistic standpoint, it suffers from a loss of facet detail, but that is countered by the very interesting effect of the gentle curves of the light source itself. The top light bloom is distracting by being ever so slightly over done. A good solid demonstration of the creative use of lighting on the subject and a clever idea both from the technical and artistic aspects. Should place well in the challenge.', '2009-04-20 12:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445320, 781202, 101256, '<td valign="top">More an image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.</td>', 'More an image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.', '2009-04-20 12:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445322, 781823, 101256, '<td valign="top">An effective demonstration of how lighting can effect an image, but not particularly "creative" in an artistic sense. A nice crisp image which would do well in another challenge or setting, it falls just shy of being a total success with respect to the challenge subject.</td>', 'An effective demonstration of how lighting can effect an image, but not particularly "creative" in an artistic sense. A nice crisp image which would do well in another challenge or setting, it falls just shy of being a total success with respect to the challenge subject.', '2009-04-20 12:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445325, 782230, 101256, '<td valign="top">More an image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.</td>', 'More an image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.', '2009-04-20 12:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445326, 781375, 101256, '<td valign="top">More an image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.</td>', 'More an image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.', '2009-04-20 12:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445327, 781253, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very interesting concept and a creative use of light to create a mood. There are actually two images in this and with a crop to remove the top and left side to concentrate on the lighting effect might have brought this into top ten consideration and possibly a ribbon winner. As it is, it shows some creative thought. Not quite as effective as it could be, it should place withint the top twenty for creativity.</td>', 'A very interesting concept and a creative use of light to create a mood. There are actually two images in this and with a crop to remove the top and left side to concentrate on the lighting effect might have brought this into top ten consideration and possibly a ribbon winner. As it is, it shows some creative thought. Not quite as effective as it could be, it should place withint the top twenty for creativity.', '2009-04-20 13:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445331, 782121, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very effective use of lighting to create a mood piece that is very nicely captured. A little more blank space than is needed at the top and left, but the nature of the image over comes this minor issue. A good, effective image showing the different nature of using lighting effectively even if it isn''t "creative" in the objective sense. Well done.</td>', 'A very effective use of lighting to create a mood piece that is very nicely captured. A little more blank space than is needed at the top and left, but the nature of the image over comes this minor issue. A good, effective image showing the different nature of using lighting effectively even if it isn''t "creative" in the objective sense. Well done.', '2009-04-20 13:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445333, 781759, 101256, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to use lighting to create a different effect than the rather flat approach used. In another type of challenge, this would be a very effective image as the conversion is nearly perfect and well controlled.</td>', 'It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to use lighting to create a different effect than the rather flat approach used. In another type of challenge, this would be a very effective image as the conversion is nearly perfect and well controlled.', '2009-04-20 13:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445335, 782331, 101256, '<td valign="top">While a good effort, the uneven and unnatural skin tone on the right detracts from the more natural color tone on the left. The lighting also created some rather distracting highlights akin to hot pixels on the left side near the lips and the rather odd discoloration on the left upper lip. This would have worked much better using either one approach or the other in terms of lighting on the face.</td>', 'While a good effort, the uneven and unnatural skin tone on the right detracts from the more natural color tone on the left. The lighting also created some rather distracting highlights akin to hot pixels on the left side near the lips and the rather odd discoloration on the left upper lip. This would have worked much better using either one approach or the other in terms of lighting on the face.', '2009-04-20 13:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445337, 780871, 101256, '<td valign="top">Reflective light in a rather stock piece of astrophotography. In another setting or challenge this would be a great piece, but as a demonstration of lighting in a creative way, it falls short of meeting the challenge. If the author had given some thought to how reflected moon light could be used to light another subject, it would have been a much better result.</td>', 'Reflective light in a rather stock piece of astrophotography. In another setting or challenge this would be a great piece, but as a demonstration of lighting in a creative way, it falls short of meeting the challenge. If the author had given some thought to how reflected moon light could be used to light another subject, it would have been a much better result.', '2009-04-20 13:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445341, 782391, 101256, '<td valign="top">The drama inherent in how the subject was revealed is good, but it''s a rather stock piece seen in other images and not particularly "creative". Having said that, it''s still a great image - strong and purposeful mood piece that would work well in any other venue or challenge and place well.</td>', 'The drama inherent in how the subject was revealed is good, but it''s a rather stock piece seen in other images and not particularly "creative". Having said that, it''s still a great image - strong and purposeful mood piece that would work well in any other venue or challenge and place well.', '2009-04-20 13:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445346, 782386, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good demonstration of how lighting can be used to create a "noir" effect - it matches the challenge in every respect because both the subject and the lighting is used in a creative fashion to capture a mood piece that is outstanding. Sometimes images can tell stories and this image sparks the imagination which is what lighting is all about.  Well done.</td>', 'A good demonstration of how lighting can be used to create a "noir" effect - it matches the challenge in every respect because both the subject and the lighting is used in a creative fashion to capture a mood piece that is outstanding. Sometimes images can tell stories and this image sparks the imagination which is what lighting is all about.  Well done.', '2009-04-20 13:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445353, 782069, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another use of lighting that marginally meets the challenge - subtle and very effective, it''s a hard one to rate as this image would do well in any sort of minimalist challenge or competition. A good effort just missing the mark in terms of creativity. It might have been better if the author had concentrated on the reflection rather than the egg.</td>', 'Another use of lighting that marginally meets the challenge - subtle and very effective, it''s a hard one to rate as this image would do well in any sort of minimalist challenge or competition. A good effort just missing the mark in terms of creativity. It might have been better if the author had concentrated on the reflection rather than the egg.', '2009-04-20 13:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445354, 782401, 101256, '<td valign="top">More an image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.</td>', 'More an image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.', '2009-04-20 13:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445355, 781757, 101256, '<td valign="top">More an image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.</td>', 'More an image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.', '2009-04-20 13:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445502, 782190, 106104, '<td valign="top">Very cool!</td>', 'Very cool!', '2009-04-20 14:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445523, 781831, 101668, '<td valign="top">Love this. The colours are tremendous. Great Pic.</td>', 'Love this. The colours are tremendous. Great Pic.', '2009-04-20 14:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445526, 782112, 101668, '<td valign="top">Love this. Wonderful and all the other superlatives!</td>', 'Love this. Wonderful and all the other superlatives!', '2009-04-20 14:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445539, 782105, 101668, '<td valign="top">Don''t you just love that place? Wonderful picture of my favourite city. Outside South Africa that is!!Great job.</td>', 'Don''t you just love that place? Wonderful picture of my favourite city. Outside South Africa that is!!Great job.', '2009-04-20 15:06:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5445560, 781859, 104010, '<td valign="top">I love the mornings, especially in spring. Glad to see someone shares the same appreciation!</td>', 'I love the mornings, especially in spring. Glad to see someone shares the same appreciation!', '2009-04-20 15:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445561, 782441, 104010, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2009-04-20 15:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445562, 781473, 104010, '<td valign="top">Absolutely awesome abstract photo!</td>', 'Absolutely awesome abstract photo!', '2009-04-20 15:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445563, 781947, 104010, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo for challenge!</td>', 'Fantastic photo for challenge!', '2009-04-20 15:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445565, 781456, 104010, '<td valign="top">I''d hate to be down there in the dark! LOL!</td>', 'I''d hate to be down there in the dark! LOL!', '2009-04-20 15:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445568, 782060, 104010, '<td valign="top">...at last! Some peace and quiet!</td>', '...at last! Some peace and quiet!', '2009-04-20 15:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445591, 782245, 101256, '<td valign="top">An interesting use of lighting to create a mode. The image might have been a little better composed if more concentration on the light through the lamp had been the subject completely and the image more centered rather than offset. At a minimum it meets the challenge criteria.</td>', 'An interesting use of lighting to create a mode. The image might have been a little better composed if more concentration on the light through the lamp had been the subject completely and the image more centered rather than offset. At a minimum it meets the challenge criteria.', '2009-04-20 15:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445597, 782116, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good demonstration of how lighting can be used to create a "noir" effect - it matches the challenge in every respect because both the subject and the lighting is used in a creative fashion to capture a mood piece that is outstanding. Sometimes images can tell stories and this image sparks the imagination which is what lighting is all about.  Well done.</td>', 'A good demonstration of how lighting can be used to create a "noir" effect - it matches the challenge in every respect because both the subject and the lighting is used in a creative fashion to capture a mood piece that is outstanding. Sometimes images can tell stories and this image sparks the imagination which is what lighting is all about.  Well done.', '2009-04-20 15:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445599, 782221, 101256, '<td valign="top">Similar in concept to other images in this challenge, this image is clearly different if only because of the use of colored lighting to create a completely different look. Not a normal portrait, the sharp division between light and shadow, the textured shades and barely visible background on the lighted side of the face is clearly well thought out and captured. The author clearly met the challenge square on and submitted an image that clearly met the challenge specs. Well done.</td>', 'Similar in concept to other images in this challenge, this image is clearly different if only because of the use of colored lighting to create a completely different look. Not a normal portrait, the sharp division between light and shadow, the textured shades and barely visible background on the lighted side of the face is clearly well thought out and captured. The author clearly met the challenge square on and submitted an image that clearly met the challenge specs. Well done.', '2009-04-20 15:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445602, 781942, 101256, '<td valign="top">More an image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself or to concentrate on a macro shot to capture more the the effects of light flare on the clouds.</td>', 'More an image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself or to concentrate on a macro shot to capture more the the effects of light flare on the clouds.', '2009-04-20 15:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445606, 781456, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good demonstration of how lighting can be used to create a "noir" effect - it matches the challenge in every respect because both the subject and the lighting is used in a creative fashion to capture a mood piece that is outstanding. Sometimes images can tell stories and this image sparks the imagination which is what lighting is all about.  Well done.</td>', 'A good demonstration of how lighting can be used to create a "noir" effect - it matches the challenge in every respect because both the subject and the lighting is used in a creative fashion to capture a mood piece that is outstanding. Sometimes images can tell stories and this image sparks the imagination which is what lighting is all about.  Well done.', '2009-04-20 15:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445607, 781907, 101256, '<td valign="top">It''s a hard subject challenge and this reviewer is having just as hard of a time properly rating images in the challenge.  Having said all that however, this is a spectacular image and in any other setting and/or challenge would be a sure top ten image - it''s spectacular, well controlled and very dramatic.</td>', 'It''s a hard subject challenge and this reviewer is having just as hard of a time properly rating images in the challenge.  Having said all that however, this is a spectacular image and in any other setting and/or challenge would be a sure top ten image - it''s spectacular, well controlled and very dramatic.', '2009-04-20 15:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445609, 780865, 101256, '<td valign="top">It''s a hard subject challenge and this reviewer is having just as hard of a time properly rating images in the challenge.  Having said all that however, this is a spectacular image and in any other setting and/or challenge would be a sure top ten image - it''s spectacular, well controlled and very dramatic.</td>', 'It''s a hard subject challenge and this reviewer is having just as hard of a time properly rating images in the challenge.  Having said all that however, this is a spectacular image and in any other setting and/or challenge would be a sure top ten image - it''s spectacular, well controlled and very dramatic.', '2009-04-20 16:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445615, 782279, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes a challenge provides a method to stretch the author''s concepts and abilities in meeting subjective criteria. In this case, clearly the author thought it out and composed an outstanding image using standard macro techniques adding artistic offset and a different use of DOF to create what is viewed by this reviewer as simply perfect. From the nicely rounded effect of the magnifying glass frame to the detail in the leather material to the clever use of lighting to keep a smooth even tonal quality to the color this is an example of thinking out side the box and a brilliant use of everyday material to create a spectacular image. This should be a ribbon winner if not the top prize. Well done.</td>', 'Sometimes a challenge provides a method to stretch the author''s concepts and abilities in meeting subjective criteria. In this case, clearly the author thought it out and composed an outstanding image using standard macro techniques adding artistic offset and a different use of DOF to create what is viewed by this reviewer as simply perfect. From the nicely rounded effect of the magnifying glass frame to the detail in the leather material to the clever use of lighting to keep a smooth even tonal quality to the color this is an example of thinking out side the box and a brilliant use of everyday material to create a spectacular image. This should be a ribbon winner if not the top prize. Well done.', '2009-04-20 16:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445618, 781025, 101256, '<td valign="top">It''s a hard subject challenge and this reviewer is having just as hard of a time properly rating images in the challenge.  The meet a creative lighting challenge, it is necessary to approach the subject matter in a unique fashion and this image accomplishes that nicely. The subtle tones and transition from light to dark is simply stunning demonstrating the proper use of lighting in a creative way that many others have failed to grasp. Sure to be a sure top ten image - it''s spectacular, well controlled and very dramatic which if all was right in the world, would make it a ribbon winner.</td>', 'It''s a hard subject challenge and this reviewer is having just as hard of a time properly rating images in the challenge.  The meet a creative lighting challenge, it is necessary to approach the subject matter in a unique fashion and this image accomplishes that nicely. The subtle tones and transition from light to dark is simply stunning demonstrating the proper use of lighting in a creative way that many others have failed to grasp. Sure to be a sure top ten image - it''s spectacular, well controlled and very dramatic which if all was right in the world, would make it a ribbon winner.', '2009-04-20 16:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445622, 782125, 101849, '<td valign="top">Amazing Picture. Love the long exposures.</td>', 'Amazing Picture. Love the long exposures.', '2009-04-20 16:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445630, 781632, 101256, '<td valign="top">While not exactly a typical challenge entry, this author strived to be different and succeeded in doing so. A very clever use of positioning and being in the right place at the right time, the ball of the sun balancing on the top of the cooling tower (assumed that''s what it was) is unique and using the sun as the lighting subject while providing the light used is certainly a creative use of lighting and meets the challenge subject squarely. This is an image that could have gone horribly wrong and instead went perfectly right. It could be a little smaller to enhance the effect of the sun''s position, but it''s certainly acceptable as it is and clearly a cut above the average entry into this challenge. The author should be proud of this image - well done.</td>', 'While not exactly a typical challenge entry, this author strived to be different and succeeded in doing so. A very clever use of positioning and being in the right place at the right time, the ball of the sun balancing on the top of the cooling tower (assumed that''s what it was) is unique and using the sun as the lighting subject while providing the light used is certainly a creative use of lighting and meets the challenge subject squarely. This is an image that could have gone horribly wrong and instead went perfectly right. It could be a little smaller to enhance the effect of the sun''s position, but it''s certainly acceptable as it is and clearly a cut above the average entry into this challenge. The author should be proud of this image - well done.', '2009-04-20 16:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445636, 782398, 101256, '<td valign="top">With the whites right on the edge, the dramatic and detailed sky, clear crisp imagery demonstrating a knowledge of how light affects an image - a worthy entry into the challenge and so far above the average entry in this challenge it''s in a whole other class. A good demonstration of how lighting can be used to create a "noir" effect - it matches the challenge in every respect because both the subject and the lighting is used in a creative fashion to capture a mood piece that is outstanding. Sometimes images can tell stories and this image sparks the imagination which is what lighting is all about.  Well done.</td>', 'With the whites right on the edge, the dramatic and detailed sky, clear crisp imagery demonstrating a knowledge of how light affects an image - a worthy entry into the challenge and so far above the average entry in this challenge it''s in a whole other class. A good demonstration of how lighting can be used to create a "noir" effect - it matches the challenge in every respect because both the subject and the lighting is used in a creative fashion to capture a mood piece that is outstanding. Sometimes images can tell stories and this image sparks the imagination which is what lighting is all about.  Well done.', '2009-04-20 16:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445637, 782399, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good demonstration of how lighting can be used to create a "noir" effect - it matches the challenge in every respect because both the subject and the lighting is used in a creative fashion to capture a mood piece that is outstanding. Sometimes images can tell stories and this image sparks the imagination which is what lighting is all about.  Well done.</td>', 'A good demonstration of how lighting can be used to create a "noir" effect - it matches the challenge in every respect because both the subject and the lighting is used in a creative fashion to capture a mood piece that is outstanding. Sometimes images can tell stories and this image sparks the imagination which is what lighting is all about.  Well done.', '2009-04-20 16:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445641, 782000, 101256, '<td valign="top">Unique and purposeful, this entry is a clear demonstration of how to use lighting in a creative way. While not a particularly interesting image, it does demonstrate how to use lighting to create mood and simple effects that are visually pleasing to the eye. A great demonstration of lighting and it''s effects on a closed environment. The author might have done a little better if a longer focal length was used to include the subject''s shadow or a little higher angle to provide some depth and dimension. Still, a worthy entry into the challenge and a cut above the other entries that did not meet the challenge criteria. Well done.</td>', 'Unique and purposeful, this entry is a clear demonstration of how to use lighting in a creative way. While not a particularly interesting image, it does demonstrate how to use lighting to create mood and simple effects that are visually pleasing to the eye. A great demonstration of lighting and it''s effects on a closed environment. The author might have done a little better if a longer focal length was used to include the subject''s shadow or a little higher angle to provide some depth and dimension. Still, a worthy entry into the challenge and a cut above the other entries that did not meet the challenge criteria. Well done.', '2009-04-20 16:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445646, 781635, 101256, '<td valign="top">Lighting can be used to create a special effect - the lighting is used in a creative fashion to capture a mood piece that is outstanding. Time lapse is all about lighting and capturing what light is available to create a certain look and this certainly meets the challenge criteria in fine fashion. Well done.</td>', 'Lighting can be used to create a special effect - the lighting is used in a creative fashion to capture a mood piece that is outstanding. Time lapse is all about lighting and capturing what light is available to create a certain look and this certainly meets the challenge criteria in fine fashion. Well done.', '2009-04-20 16:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445650, 781833, 101256, '<td valign="top">Clever and inventive, this is a different look at how lighting can be used to enhance an everyday object and make it different. Unfortunately, the image isn''t as crisp and sharp as it should be giving a slightly unfocused look which is annoying - the author would have done better to properly focus the image, but given the soft nature of the light used, that would have been difficult. Having said that, it does meet the challenge criteria perfectly and as such, a cut above the less than stellar entries into this challenge. Well done.</td>', 'Clever and inventive, this is a different look at how lighting can be used to enhance an everyday object and make it different. Unfortunately, the image isn''t as crisp and sharp as it should be giving a slightly unfocused look which is annoying - the author would have done better to properly focus the image, but given the soft nature of the light used, that would have been difficult. Having said that, it does meet the challenge criteria perfectly and as such, a cut above the less than stellar entries into this challenge. Well done.', '2009-04-20 16:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445655, 782329, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good demonstration of how lighting can be used to create a special effect - it matches the challenge in every respect because both the subject and the lighting is used in a creative fashion to capture a mood piece that, while not in rare terrority, it at least a cut above other entries. This image sparks the imagination which is what lighting is all about.  Well done.</td>', 'A good demonstration of how lighting can be used to create a special effect - it matches the challenge in every respect because both the subject and the lighting is used in a creative fashion to capture a mood piece that, while not in rare terrority, it at least a cut above other entries. This image sparks the imagination which is what lighting is all about.  Well done.', '2009-04-20 16:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445657, 781912, 101256, '<td valign="top">More a image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.</td>', 'More a image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.', '2009-04-20 16:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445671, 780996, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another excellant image that it a cut above the other portrait entries in this challenge. A true masterpiece, the menace and threatning imagery provided by the offset visage and lighting is simply a brilliant choice. The transition from light to dark is smooth and barely noticable and the monotone treatment only enhances what the author has done with the lighting. Well done and a true potential ribbon winner.<br/> <br/>PS: It was very noticable to this viewer that the model in this image is somewhat amused by the drama - if you look close enough and combine the lip line with the "evil eye", you can see clearly that the model is about to bust out laughing after trying very hard to project a eeeevvvvviiiiillll presence. Highly amusing.</td>', 'Another excellant image that it a cut above the other portrait entries in this challenge. A true masterpiece, the menace and threatning imagery provided by the offset visage and lighting is simply a brilliant choice. The transition from light to dark is smooth and barely noticable and the monotone treatment only enhances what the author has done with the lighting. Well done and a true potential ribbon winner. PS: It was very noticable to this viewer that the model in this image is somewhat amused by the drama - if you look close enough and combine the lip line with the "evil eye", you can see clearly that the model is about to bust out laughing after trying very hard to project a eeeevvvvviiiiillll presence. Highly amusing.', '2009-04-20 16:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445672, 782330, 101256, '<td valign="top">More a image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.</td>', 'More a image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.', '2009-04-20 16:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445676, 780897, 101256, '<td valign="top">This reviewer is always up for a good laugh and the humor demonstrated in this image is outstanding - even it it doesn''t QUITE match the challenge subject. In fact, this reviewer likes this so much, it''s going on the print wish list just for the fact that it''s funny, it has light and who cares - a solid ten just for the break from all the mundane images being ploughed through. Well done.</td>', 'This reviewer is always up for a good laugh and the humor demonstrated in this image is outstanding - even it it doesn''t QUITE match the challenge subject. In fact, this reviewer likes this so much, it''s going on the print wish list just for the fact that it''s funny, it has light and who cares - a solid ten just for the break from all the mundane images being ploughed through. Well done.', '2009-04-20 16:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445677, 780938, 101256, '<td valign="top">More a image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.</td>', 'More a image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.', '2009-04-20 16:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445679, 781751, 101256, '<td valign="top">This was a very different look at lighting and the use of lighting - a well thought out and captured composition that exactly matches the challenge subject. While the image could be much more crisp and sharp, it serves the soft lighting well. Not a top contender, but certainly a top twenty for the inventive use of lighting and subject matter.</td>', 'This was a very different look at lighting and the use of lighting - a well thought out and captured composition that exactly matches the challenge subject. While the image could be much more crisp and sharp, it serves the soft lighting well. Not a top contender, but certainly a top twenty for the inventive use of lighting and subject matter.', '2009-04-20 16:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445684, 781603, 101256, '<td valign="top">Less than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. As an entry into a different challenge, this would be a difficult image to beat given it''s gentle and soft, yet detailed appearance. The author might have done better to use some backlight to create other effects.</td>', 'Less than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. As an entry into a different challenge, this would be a difficult image to beat given it''s gentle and soft, yet detailed appearance. The author might have done better to use some backlight to create other effects.', '2009-04-20 16:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445698, 781855, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes the image so matches the challenge subject that speechless is the only comment one can make if one uses a loose definition of "creative" which would be inspired - this is certainly in the inspired category. The rich color and detail is remarkable and highlighted perfectly. This reviewer can find enough superlatives to describe the pure raw emotion and impact of this image. Wonderful is inadequate, brilliant portraiture come close. A favorite to win a ribbon.</td>', 'Sometimes the image so matches the challenge subject that speechless is the only comment one can make if one uses a loose definition of "creative" which would be inspired - this is certainly in the inspired category. The rich color and detail is remarkable and highlighted perfectly. This reviewer can find enough superlatives to describe the pure raw emotion and impact of this image. Wonderful is inadequate, brilliant portraiture come close. A favorite to win a ribbon.', '2009-04-20 17:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445700, 782414, 101256, '<td valign="top">Imaginative ues of natural light, this ethereal image is a very good demonstration of how to use natural light to it''s best advantage and creative in the sense that it captured the light and it''s effects in a natural setting perfectly. An excellant entry into the challenge and worthy of a top ten placement.</td>', 'Imaginative ues of natural light, this ethereal image is a very good demonstration of how to use natural light to it''s best advantage and creative in the sense that it captured the light and it''s effects in a natural setting perfectly. An excellant entry into the challenge and worthy of a top ten placement.', '2009-04-20 17:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445702, 782358, 101256, '<td valign="top">A difficult shot to pull of in the best of circumstances, this is a creative use of lighting, unfortunately it falls just short of being really effective. The overdone flash created a cartoonish effect on the palm and detracts from the rather dramatic sky. A softer flash, perhaps through a gause screen or a light reducer would have been a better choice. A good solid effort though and it clearly meets the challenge criteria.</td>', 'A difficult shot to pull of in the best of circumstances, this is a creative use of lighting, unfortunately it falls just short of being really effective. The overdone flash created a cartoonish effect on the palm and detracts from the rather dramatic sky. A softer flash, perhaps through a gause screen or a light reducer would have been a better choice. A good solid effort though and it clearly meets the challenge criteria.', '2009-04-20 17:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445708, 781056, 101256, '<td valign="top">More of a lighted shot than a creative use of lighting, this image falls short of meeting the challenge criteria in several ways. While a good image, the author might have chosen to use the available lighting to create an effect rather than just a image that is actually of snapshot quality. A little more thought would have helped as there are possibilities in this image such as a macro which would not only have met the criteria, but have placed high.</td>', 'More of a lighted shot than a creative use of lighting, this image falls short of meeting the challenge criteria in several ways. While a good image, the author might have chosen to use the available lighting to create an effect rather than just a image that is actually of snapshot quality. A little more thought would have helped as there are possibilities in this image such as a macro which would not only have met the criteria, but have placed high.', '2009-04-20 17:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445713, 780730, 101256, '<td valign="top">Imaginative and clever, this image clearly meets the challenge criteria. Having said that, there is something missing it''s just not clear what it is to make this a truly outstanding image. It may be that the left side curve is cut off or that the light bloom is slightly over the edge near the lip of the glass, but it just not quite there to make it a ribbon contender. A top twenty image certainly.</td>', 'Imaginative and clever, this image clearly meets the challenge criteria. Having said that, there is something missing it''s just not clear what it is to make this a truly outstanding image. It may be that the left side curve is cut off or that the light bloom is slightly over the edge near the lip of the glass, but it just not quite there to make it a ribbon contender. A top twenty image certainly.', '2009-04-20 17:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445715, 781947, 101256, '<td valign="top">More of a lighted shot than a creative use of lighting, this image falls short of meeting the challenge criteria in several ways. While a good image, the author might have chosen to use the available lighting to create an effect rather than just a image that is actually of snapshot quality. A little more thought would have helped as there are possibilities in this image that with a litle more creativity, would have made it a contender.</td>', 'More of a lighted shot than a creative use of lighting, this image falls short of meeting the challenge criteria in several ways. While a good image, the author might have chosen to use the available lighting to create an effect rather than just a image that is actually of snapshot quality. A little more thought would have helped as there are possibilities in this image that with a litle more creativity, would have made it a contender.', '2009-04-20 17:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
