(5445762, 782101, 101256, '<td valign="top">An effective demonstration of lighting and how it can be used creatively to achieve a special effect. This image, with it''s attendant grain, creates an ethereal atmosphere - a very noir concept which is intense and powerfull, it sparks the imagination and tells any number of different stories.  One of the best entries in this challenge so far which should place well in the top ten if not a ribbon winner. Well done.</td>', 'An effective demonstration of lighting and how it can be used creatively to achieve a special effect. This image, with it''s attendant grain, creates an ethereal atmosphere - a very noir concept which is intense and powerfull, it sparks the imagination and tells any number of different stories.  One of the best entries in this challenge so far which should place well in the top ten if not a ribbon winner. Well done.', '2009-04-20 17:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
