(5445782, 781859, 101256, '<td valign="top">Effective and intriguing, it''s more of a use of natural lighting to create an effect than a straight nicely lit image. It might have been better to crop the top off to create a more compact and interesting image with the effect of creating an impression of indirect lighting. A good solid entry into the challenge - not particularly interesting, but an effective demonstration of how to use light to it''s best effect.</td>', 'Effective and intriguing, it''s more of a use of natural lighting to create an effect than a straight nicely lit image. It might have been better to crop the top off to create a more compact and interesting image with the effect of creating an impression of indirect lighting. A good solid entry into the challenge - not particularly interesting, but an effective demonstration of how to use light to it''s best effect.', '2009-04-20 17:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445831, 782237, 101256, '<td valign="top">The problem with bouncing lighting is that sometimes one can achieve a uneven effect that detracts from the image. The colors on this image seem to be overly saturated which is a negative. A good use of bounce which is just a little uneven.</td>', 'The problem with bouncing lighting is that sometimes one can achieve a uneven effect that detracts from the image. The colors on this image seem to be overly saturated which is a negative. A good use of bounce which is just a little uneven.', '2009-04-20 18:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445836, 782361, 101256, '<td valign="top">An interesting effect and by product of indirect lighting.  The image might have been improved by concentrating on the effect on the stairs with a closer shot, but as it is, it is a clear demonstration of how to properly capture indirect lighting to good effect. A nice eye for abstracts, the author did well to see and use the effects. Well done.</td>', 'An interesting effect and by product of indirect lighting.  The image might have been improved by concentrating on the effect on the stairs with a closer shot, but as it is, it is a clear demonstration of how to properly capture indirect lighting to good effect. A nice eye for abstracts, the author did well to see and use the effects. Well done.', '2009-04-20 18:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445837, 782344, 101256, '<td valign="top">An interesting effect and by product of indirect lighting.  This image is a clear demonstration of how to properly capture indirect lighting to good effect. A nice eye for abstracts, the author did well to see and use the effects. Well done.</td>', 'An interesting effect and by product of indirect lighting.  This image is a clear demonstration of how to properly capture indirect lighting to good effect. A nice eye for abstracts, the author did well to see and use the effects. Well done.', '2009-04-20 18:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445840, 782304, 101256, '<td valign="top">More a image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.</td>', 'More a image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.', '2009-04-20 18:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
