(5445922, 781993, 101256, '<td valign="top">While an effective image, the monotone treatment overwhelms the lighting being used and not as effective as it might be. A good solid effort in lighting from an angle and certainly within the parameters of the challenge subject.</td>', 'While an effective image, the monotone treatment overwhelms the lighting being used and not as effective as it might be. A good solid effort in lighting from an angle and certainly within the parameters of the challenge subject.', '2009-04-20 19:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445926, 782303, 101256, '<td valign="top">More a image of lighting a spectacular object than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature as this is not special or creative in the sense that it''s a very common image taken and viewed by thousands over the years. As a standalone image, it is beautiful and fully representative of the American South West, but as a creative use of lighting, is falls somewhat short.</td>', 'More a image of lighting a spectacular object than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature as this is not special or creative in the sense that it''s a very common image taken and viewed by thousands over the years. As a standalone image, it is beautiful and fully representative of the American South West, but as a creative use of lighting, is falls somewhat short.', '2009-04-20 19:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445933, 782437, 101256, '<td valign="top">On a third viewing it became apparent that there is a lot going on in this image directly related to creative use of lighting that wasn''t readily apparent on previous views - perhaps an effect of the author trying to be too subtle with the effects. Having said that, it is a very good example of understated lighting with the subtle background, clear glass and right on the edge white of the bulb''s filiments. A very creative look at manufactured lighting. Well done.</td>', 'On a third viewing it became apparent that there is a lot going on in this image directly related to creative use of lighting that wasn''t readily apparent on previous views - perhaps an effect of the author trying to be too subtle with the effects. Having said that, it is a very good example of understated lighting with the subtle background, clear glass and right on the edge white of the bulb''s filiments. A very creative look at manufactured lighting. Well done.', '2009-04-20 19:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445937, 781851, 101256, '<td valign="top">Several views of this image did not affect the initial impression of the author being not only creative with lighting, but using light to great effect with the extremely clever inclusing of all three colors into the stem of the center glass. Perfect DOF control. An example of how creative use of lighting and lighting systems can create a stunning image. A ribbon contender if not an outright winner.</td>', 'Several views of this image did not affect the initial impression of the author being not only creative with lighting, but using light to great effect with the extremely clever inclusing of all three colors into the stem of the center glass. Perfect DOF control. An example of how creative use of lighting and lighting systems can create a stunning image. A ribbon contender if not an outright winner.', '2009-04-20 19:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445941, 780703, 101256, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It''s not particularly creative in the sense of being a creative use of light. It is an amazing and stunning image, it''s just not right for this challenge.</td>', 'It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It''s not particularly creative in the sense of being a creative use of light. It is an amazing and stunning image, it''s just not right for this challenge.', '2009-04-20 19:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445943, 782060, 101256, '<td valign="top">An interesting use of ambient light to create a visual effect. The subtle shapes and colors are beautiful giving the viewer a sense of peace and quiet not normally available on a daily basis. A good, solid entry into the challenge, there is nothing about this image to even nit pick. Well done.</td>', 'An interesting use of ambient light to create a visual effect. The subtle shapes and colors are beautiful giving the viewer a sense of peace and quiet not normally available on a daily basis. A good, solid entry into the challenge, there is nothing about this image to even nit pick. Well done.', '2009-04-20 19:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445944, 782375, 101256, '<td valign="top">More a image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to use a macro lens or approach and concentrate on a particular part of the flower that was affected in a unique way by the light.</td>', 'More a image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to use a macro lens or approach and concentrate on a particular part of the flower that was affected in a unique way by the light.', '2009-04-20 19:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445945, 782352, 101256, '<td valign="top">More a image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.</td>', 'More a image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.', '2009-04-20 19:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445947, 781404, 101256, '<td valign="top">More a image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.</td>', 'More a image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.', '2009-04-20 19:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445948, 781788, 101256, '<td valign="top">More a image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.</td>', 'More a image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.', '2009-04-20 19:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445949, 782191, 101256, '<td valign="top">More a image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.</td>', 'More a image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.', '2009-04-20 19:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445950, 782243, 101256, '<td valign="top">More a image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.</td>', 'More a image of lighting than a creative use of lighting. It''s hard to rate this because of it''s nature. It might have been a better approach to find a subject and then use the lighting to create the image rather than of the light itself.', '2009-04-20 19:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445955, 782397, 101256, '<td valign="top">The author''s intent was clear and the use of light is creative, unfortunately the overall impression is of unnatural light which washes out the entire image and creates a negative impact. It might have been better if the author didn''t attempt to be artsy, but create a direct shot from the back of the bride into the light with a lower aperature setting to create a halo effect without the odd and uncomfortable angle. A good effort and a demonstration of direct lighting, just a little over the top trying to create an "art" image.</td>', 'The author''s intent was clear and the use of light is creative, unfortunately the overall impression is of unnatural light which washes out the entire image and creates a negative impact. It might have been better if the author didn''t attempt to be artsy, but create a direct shot from the back of the bride into the light with a lower aperature setting to create a halo effect without the odd and uncomfortable angle. A good effort and a demonstration of direct lighting, just a little over the top trying to create an "art" image.', '2009-04-20 19:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445974, 782112, 101256, '<td valign="top">Even after multiple views, it''s sometimes hard to define the author''s intent. In those cases, it''s often best to just give the benefit of the doubt to the author and just let an opinion fly. This is a great image in particular with the intentional (unintentional?) starfield which technically is a source of night light not ordinarily seen in areas that are light polluted. Simple and direct. Ah heck with it - well done.</td>', 'Even after multiple views, it''s sometimes hard to define the author''s intent. In those cases, it''s often best to just give the benefit of the doubt to the author and just let an opinion fly. This is a great image in particular with the intentional (unintentional?) starfield which technically is a source of night light not ordinarily seen in areas that are light polluted. Simple and direct. Ah heck with it - well done.', '2009-04-20 20:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445976, 781602, 101256, '<td valign="top">A common theme at DPC is the offset subject and frankly, it''s becoming so common that the treatment is unremarkable and fast becoming an also ran in terms of creativity and very cliche''. Fortunately in this case, the lightly figured background helps and the use of lighting is effective even with the minor little light bloom on the left edge of the leaf. A good example proper lighting revealing rich detail to good effect.</td>', 'A common theme at DPC is the offset subject and frankly, it''s becoming so common that the treatment is unremarkable and fast becoming an also ran in terms of creativity and very cliche''. Fortunately in this case, the lightly figured background helps and the use of lighting is effective even with the minor little light bloom on the left edge of the leaf. A good example proper lighting revealing rich detail to good effect.', '2009-04-20 20:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445978, 782408, 101256, '<td valign="top">A fifth view and benefit of doubt to the author. A spectacular image creatively lighted by direct soft light. A good how to highlight certain areas without negatively affecting other areas creating a other worldly impression. Very artistic and technically perfect. Well done.</td>', 'A fifth view and benefit of doubt to the author. A spectacular image creatively lighted by direct soft light. A good how to highlight certain areas without negatively affecting other areas creating a other worldly impression. Very artistic and technically perfect. Well done.', '2009-04-20 20:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445979, 781703, 101256, '<td valign="top">A sixth viewing and a final decision is that this is more of a terrific macro shot rather than a "creative" use of lighting. Having said that, a synonym for "creative" is inspired and this is certainly an inspired image well lit for effect. Benefit of doubt to the author - well done.</td>', 'A sixth viewing and a final decision is that this is more of a terrific macro shot rather than a "creative" use of lighting. Having said that, a synonym for "creative" is inspired and this is certainly an inspired image well lit for effect. Benefit of doubt to the author - well done.', '2009-04-20 20:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
