(5447736, 782440, 65319, '<td valign="top">A tough entry for lighting which is very subtle in this photo and will not be well-understood by the voters.  To get a blur photo not just of one bird but TWO that look this good is amazingly difficult and you did a terrific job.  While it doesn''t hit the challenge topic right between the eyes (thus your score), this photo is FABULOUS in and of itself!  Very well done!</td>', 'A tough entry for lighting which is very subtle in this photo and will not be well-understood by the voters.  To get a blur photo not just of one bird but TWO that look this good is amazingly difficult and you did a terrific job.  While it doesn''t hit the challenge topic right between the eyes (thus your score), this photo is FABULOUS in and of itself!  Very well done!', '2009-04-22 01:17:23.000000', NULL, 0),
