(5447895, 782095, 22301, '<td valign="top">You should really use the Save for Web feature to get your images ready for challenges. It will let you set the file size and image size to the max levels. Here is a <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tutorial</a> that will help you out. I think making this full size would have put you at least in the top 5. Looking forward to some full sized entries from you. :)</td>', 'You should really use the Save for Web feature to get your images ready for challenges. It will let you set the file size and image size to the max levels. Here is a tutorial that will help you out. I think making this full size would have put you at least in the top 5. Looking forward to some full sized entries from you. :)', '2009-04-22 02:42:40.000000', NULL, 0),
