(5448242, 781971, 67697, '<td valign="top">Oh Panos I thought this was very cool and I would have expected it to finish higher.  I love how the sun is highlighting just part of your face (great clarity btw for a hand-held shot) and the cigarette really enhances the noir-like feel.  Now on to the anti-smoking part of my message... :P<br/> <br/>Great shot!</td>', 'Oh Panos I thought this was very cool and I would have expected it to finish higher.  I love how the sun is highlighting just part of your face (great clarity btw for a hand-held shot) and the cigarette really enhances the noir-like feel.  Now on to the anti-smoking part of my message... :P Great shot!', '2009-04-22 09:25:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5448247, 781394, 67697, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, Josh.  I love the quality of light and sharpness on your macro shots.</td>', 'Lovely photo, Josh.  I love the quality of light and sharpness on your macro shots.', '2009-04-22 09:29:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5448249, 782437, 67697, '<td valign="top">I thought this might have finished higher.  I gave it a 7.  I loved the simplicity of the shot and the fact that the light was kind of shimmering on the wall behind it.</td>', 'I thought this might have finished higher.  I gave it a 7.  I loved the simplicity of the shot and the fact that the light was kind of shimmering on the wall behind it.', '2009-04-22 09:30:58.000000', NULL, 0),
