(5448856, 782206, 101678, '<td valign="top">It does appear that way!  As Joe McNally says "If you want to take more interesting pictures, get your camera in more interesting places!"  Take good care of yourself over there.  We are all thinking about you guys/gals and thankful for what you do for us.  I like that you can use your camera to make beautiful images there - probably makes being away more bearable.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-04-22 15:24:48.</i></td>', 'It does appear that way!  As Joe McNally says "If you want to take more interesting pictures, get your camera in more interesting places!"  Take good care of yourself over there.  We are all thinking about you guys/gals and thankful for what you do for us.  I like that you can use your camera to make beautiful images there - probably makes being away more bearable.', '2009-04-22 16:24:06.000000', '2009-04-22 16:24:48.000000', 0),
