(5450118, 782206, 24454, '<td valign="top">Cory! Wow!  I am so looking forward to the upcoming months then!  This is such a great photo.  Photojournalism at its best.  This is a perspective on the pressures and "real life" parts of our troops'' jobs that we don''t often get to see.   I can''t even <i>begin</i> to tell you and everyone else serving in our military how much I appreciate the work you do!!  <br/> <br/>Congratulations on an honorable mention.  This is such a great addition to your portfolio.   Can''t wait to see more!</td>', 'Cory! Wow!  I am so looking forward to the upcoming months then!  This is such a great photo.  Photojournalism at its best.  This is a perspective on the pressures and "real life" parts of our troops'' jobs that we don''t often get to see.   I can''t even begin to tell you and everyone else serving in our military how much I appreciate the work you do!!   Congratulations on an honorable mention.  This is such a great addition to your portfolio.   Can''t wait to see more!', '2009-04-23 16:42:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5450120, 781025, 24454, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of your best portrait photos.  And that''s saying alot since you have so many phenomenal photos.  The light is so dramatic and beautiful.  Congratulations on jumping back in and showing up on the front page :)   <br/> <br/></td>', 'I think this is one of your best portrait photos.  And that''s saying alot since you have so many phenomenal photos.  The light is so dramatic and beautiful.  Congratulations on jumping back in and showing up on the front page :)    ', '2009-04-23 16:44:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5450256, 782206, 16106, '<td valign="top">Grats on the high finish, but I think it would have done better in an open challenge. The light is about the fifth best thing in this shot. The subject matter is very interesting and the framing, focus and use of the rule of thirds is perfect. Dense, compelling and very well done.</td>', 'Grats on the high finish, but I think it would have done better in an open challenge. The light is about the fifth best thing in this shot. The subject matter is very interesting and the framing, focus and use of the rule of thirds is perfect. Dense, compelling and very well done.', '2009-04-23 20:00:17.000000', NULL, 0),
