(5452765, 781602, 88580, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Teafran:</b></div><hr/><i> A common theme at DPC is the offset subject and frankly, it''s becoming so common that the treatment is unremarkable and fast becoming an also ran in terms of creativity and very cliche''. Fortunately in this case, the lightly figured background helps and the use of lighting is effective even with the minor little light bloom on the left edge of the leaf. A good example proper lighting revealing rich detail to good effect. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Agree about the cliche-ed-ness.  Very disappointed at my conformity.</td>', 'Originally posted by Teafran: A common theme at DPC is the offset subject and frankly, it''s becoming so common that the treatment is unremarkable and fast becoming an also ran in terms of creativity and very cliche''. Fortunately in this case, the lightly figured background helps and the use of lighting is effective even with the minor little light bloom on the left edge of the leaf. A good example proper lighting revealing rich detail to good effect.   Agree about the cliche-ed-ness.  Very disappointed at my conformity.', '2009-04-26 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
