(5468685, 780748, 55838, '<td valign="top">5.4??!!  Boy did you ever get ripped off!  This image is cool, creative, and well shot, and it doesn''t take a rocket scientist to figure out how you did it.  My guess is that you suffered due to the assumptions made by hasty, less imaginative voters about how you achieved this cool effect.  I don''t understand why people dish out 1''s when they assume that a rule has been broken rather than simply reporting the image for validation and then voting on it as if it meets the rules.  If it fails validation then the vote is worthless anyway!  Sheesh!  You deserved a higher score on this.</td>', '5.4??!!  Boy did you ever get ripped off!  This image is cool, creative, and well shot, and it doesn''t take a rocket scientist to figure out how you did it.  My guess is that you suffered due to the assumptions made by hasty, less imaginative voters about how you achieved this cool effect.  I don''t understand why people dish out 1''s when they assume that a rule has been broken rather than simply reporting the image for validation and then voting on it as if it meets the rules.  If it fails validation then the vote is worthless anyway!  Sheesh!  You deserved a higher score on this.', '2009-05-04 21:15:02.000000', NULL, 0),
