(5508358, 781737, 101678, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Marjo:</b></div><hr/><i> Great capture! I rarely got to see this view the few times I jumpseated because I was asleep. ;) That flat panel looks familiar. Are you a freight dog? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks! Yeah, I usually sleep on the jumpseat too!  It''s an A320.  Not a freight dog - UAL.</td>', 'Originally posted by Marjo: Great capture! I rarely got to see this view the few times I jumpseated because I was asleep. ;) That flat panel looks familiar. Are you a freight dog?   Thanks! Yeah, I usually sleep on the jumpseat too!  It''s an A320.  Not a freight dog - UAL.', '2009-06-01 13:33:51.000000', NULL, 0),
